# Smooth Things: The Rockefeller Commission's Report on the Humanities.

**Authors:** Topf, Mel A.

## Abstract
Notes the lack of definition of the term &quot;humanities&quot; and the four-part litany that comprises the usual rhetoric of humanities advocates. Considers the Rockefeller Commission report on the humanities in light of the nondefinition, the four-part litany, and the fragmentation of any argument espousing &quot;more attention to the humanities.&quot; (RL)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ249812

